    "Required files not produced because Steps 1-2 did not run: scripts/s12_test.py, s12/optimisation_log.csv, s12/test.csv, s12/real_larry.csv. scripts/s12_optimise.py is committed as prepared but not executed (only its dynamo worker was probed on a toy field).",
    "No generator change was committed: v3_nofork, forward_developmental_truth_v3, seed-3 datasets and MANIFEST rows belong to Step 2. A draft of these generator edits was reverted, uncommitted, once Step 0 said stop.",
    "Step 0.1 'reproduce': both the AUC of the S10 stored operator and a full refit (OT + MeasuredDrift + jacobian_autodiff) were computed. They agree with S10's reported values to 4 decimals.",
    "Step 0.2(a) 'fraction of saddle cells': the truth classes are defined on z_true, so the fraction is identical in every embedding by construction. Reported as is, with the projection of saddle and committed cells on each embedding's fate axis added.",
    "Step 0.2(a)/(b) gene-space maps: a score-space vector v is mapped to gene space as v pinv(L), with L the embedding's stored linear map (genes x d; for FA, the posterior map).",
    "Step 0.2(c) 'S06 tangent rule' is not defined in the S06 task or scripts. It was implemented as the task text gives it: per cell, the top-5 eigenvectors U of the kNN-30 local data covariance in the embedding, and lambda1 of U^T J U. The soft-axis curvature uses S10 Step 4's soft_axis.",
    "Step 0.2(d) whitening: the cost is (z_i - z_j)^T W^T Psi^-1 W (z_i - z_j), with W the FA loadings and Psi the FA noise variances, i.e. the gene-space reconstruction difference whitened by Psi. eps = 0.05 x median of that cost. Barycentres, MeasuredDrift and J are in raw FA coordinates. This is the executor's reading of 'costs in FA whitened by the FA noise variances'.",
    "Step 0.3 PCA-10/PCA-50 come from embed_linear on the observed spliced counts (same normalisation/log1p as PCA-20). scVI-10 uses SCVI defaults, n_latent = 10, spliced counts, all genes, seed 0, default max_epochs (400) on CPU, with the posterior-mean latent. The task fixed no scVI settings beyond 10 latent dims.",
    "Decision clause 1 counts FA-20, PCA-10, PCA-50 and scVI-10 as the 'embeddings other than PCA-20'. The whitened-cost FA variant is evaluated only under clause 2 (FA fix)."
